r-color\" data-source=\"uid\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-tech-label\">UID</div></h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-tech-data\"><code>S_LOW_SteepsHarborhandCrew_Civilian1</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:S_LOW_SteepsHarborhandCrew_Civilian1+type:localcharacter%2Cglobalcharacter%2Ccharactertemplate\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:S_LOW_SteepsHarborhandCrew_Civilian1+type:localcharacter%2Cglobalcharacter%2Ccharactertemplate\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div></div>\n</div><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"uuid\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-tech-label\">UUID</div></h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-tech-data\"><code>cc0b24db-6621-426d-baea-f10248bf28a3</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:cc0b24db-6621-426d-baea-f10248bf28a3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:cc0b24db-6621-426d-baea-f10248bf28a3\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div></div>\n</div><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"stats\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-tech-label\">Stats</div></h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-tech-data\"><code>Human_Commoner</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Human_Commoner+type:statscharacter\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Human_Commoner+type:statscharacter\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div></div>\n</div></section></aside>\n<b>Ormont</b> is intent on forming an employee strike in <a href=\"/wiki/Baldur%27s_Gate\" title=\"Baldur's Gate\">Baldur's Gate</a> during <a href=\"/wiki/Act_Three\" title=\"Act Three\">Act Three</a>.\n\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r356266\">.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote{display:grid;margin:10px 4px}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-right{padding:8px 16px;margin:auto}@media screen and (max-width:779px){.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-right{margin-top:10px;padding:8px 2px;border-left:0!important;grid-row:2;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-right,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-left{margin:auto;grid-row:1;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-author{grid-row:3;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote{justify-content:center!important}}@media screen and (min-width:780px){.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left{margin-left:10px;border-left:2px solid #3d3d3d!important;grid-row:1;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-right{margin-right:10px;border-left:0!important;border-right:2px solid #3d3d3d;grid-row:1;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-right{margin:auto 0;grid-row:1;grid-column:3}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-left{margin:auto 0;grid-row:1;grid-column:1}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-author{grid-row:2;grid-column:2}}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-author{margin-left:auto;margin-right:32px;font-size:smaller;font-weight:bold}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-begin,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-end{font-size:300%;font-family:serif;color:#3d3d3d;line-height:1em}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-begin{margin-bottom:auto;margin-right:8px}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-end{margin-top:auto;margin-left:8px}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-text{font-style:italic}</style><div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote\" style=\"justify-content: center\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-left\" style=\"display: inline-block; height: calc(70px + 2*4px); width: calc(70px + 2*4px); clip-path: polygon(50% 0%, 100% 50%, 50% 100%, 0% 50%); background: black;\"><span style=\"display: inline-block; margin: 4px; width: 70px; height: 70px; clip-path: polygon(50% 0%, 100% 50%, 50% 100%, 0% 50%);\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b1/Portrait_Ormont.png/70px-Portrait_Ormont.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b1/Portrait_Ormont.png/105px-Portrait_Ormont.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b1/Portrait_Ormont.png/140px-Portrait_Ormont.png.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b1/Portrait_Ormont.png/70px-Portrait_Ormont.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/b1/Portrait_Ormont.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><blockquote style=\"font-size: 100%\" class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left\">\n  <div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center\">\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-begin\">“</div>\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-text\">They grind you down to a nub in these parts. Work you into an early grave, then don't even send flowers to your widow.</div>\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-end\">„</div>\n  </div>\n</blockquote><div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-author\">— <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Ormont</a></div><div style=\"grid-column:3\"></div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Involvement\">Involvement</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Act_Three\">Act Three</span></h3>\n<p>Ormont and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Tugelnhorn\" title=\"Tugelnhorn\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9b/Portrait_Tugelnhorn.png/25px-Portrait_Tugelnhorn.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9b/Portrait_Tugelnhorn.png/38px-Portrait_Tugelnhorn.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/9b/Portrait_Tugelnhorn.png/50px-Portrait_Tugelnhorn.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Tugelnhorn\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9b/Portrait_Tugelnhorn.png/25px-Portrait_Tugelnhorn.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9b/Portrait_Tugelnhorn.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Tugelnhorn\" title=\"Tugelnhorn\">Tugelnhorn</a> are members of the Harborhand crew. While Ormont is intent on striking, Tugelnhorn is wary that their living conditions will worsen. The pair are in the <a href=\"/wiki/Lower_City\" title=\"Lower City\">Lower City</a>, north of <a href=\"/wiki/Old_Garlow%27s_Place\" title=\"Old Garlow's Place\">Old Garlow's Place</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Idle_banter\">Idle banter</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-transcript\">\n<ul><li><dl class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-line\"><dt>Tugelnhorn</dt><dd>It ain's so bad - could be a damn sight worse. You've got a job and a place to rest your head -</dd></dl></li>\n<li><dl class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-line\"><dt>Ormont</dt><dd>- When they bloody let me rest my head.</dd></dl></li>\n<li><dl class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-line\"><dt>Tugelnhorn</dt><dd>Well plenty don't even have that, have they? What about all those refugees? They've got nothing.</dd></dl></li>\n<li><dl class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-line\"><dt>Ormont</dt><dd>What about them? You want them flooding in here, driving down our wages even more?</dd></dl></li>\n<li><dl class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-line\"><dt>Tugelnhorn</dt><dd>Well... no. Wouldn't want that.</dd></dl></li></ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-transcript\">\n<ul><li><dl class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-line\"><dt>Ormont</dt><dd>It ain't right - they're pushing folk too far.</dd></dl></li>\n<li><dl class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-line\"><dt>Tugelnhorn</dt><dd>I know, but moaning isn't helping anyone, is it?</dd></dl></li>\n<li><dl class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-line\"><dt>Ormont</dt><dd>Helps me - good to get it off your chest. Anyway, we just going to let <a href=\"/wiki/Enver_Gortash\" title=\"Enver Gortash\">what's-his-name</a> and his <a href=\"/wiki/Steel_Watcher\" title=\"Steel Watcher\">toy soldiers</a> take over the whole city?</dd></dl></li>\n<li><dl class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-line\"><dt>Tugelnhorn</dt><dd>He's not gone that far. Not even close. And if you keep talking the way you're talking, the <a href=\"/wiki/Flaming_Fist\" title=\"Flaming Fist\">Fists</a> will start breaking heads.</dd></dl></li>\n<li><dl class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-line\"><dt>Ormont</dt><dd>Good - I might get some sleep if I took a crack on the noggin.</dd></dl></li></ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-transcript\">\n<ul><li><dl class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-line\"><dt>Ormont</dt><dd>There ain't no one coming to help us - we ought to be helping ourselves. Tools down, banners up!</dd></dl></li>\n<li><dl class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-line\"><dt>Tugelnhorn</dt><dd>And what if it doesn't work?</dd></dl></li>\n<li><dl class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-line\"><dt>Ormont</dt><dd>We keep going until it <i>does</i> work. They'll give in soon enough, once their coffers run empty.</dd></dl></li>\n<li><dl class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-line\"><dt>Tugelnhorn</dt><dd>I'm more worried about what happens when my belly runs empty.</dd></dl></li></ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-transcript\">\n<ul><li><dl class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-line\"><dt>Tugelnhorn</dt><dd>Find yourself a stage, why don't you? Always bloody drama with you.</dd></dl></li>\n<li><dl class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-line\"><dt>Ormont</dt><dd>Drama? This is <i>sense.</i> Half the crew are dead on their feet, while the others are ready to drop everything and leave. We need to stand up. The longer they treat us like this, the harder it'll be to force some change.</dd></dl></li>\n<li><dl class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-line\"><dt>Tugelnhorn</dt><dd>There's a right time for a strike - but it ain't now. Not when the whole city's in danger.</dd></dl></li>\n<li><dl class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-line\"><dt>Ormont</dt><dd>Bah - there'll always be an excuse. Anything to keep us in our place.</dd></dl></li></ul>\n</div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715063902\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.173 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.179 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 5399/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 29842/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 9105/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 2/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28444/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.049/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1752803/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%  165.784      1 -total\n 81.83%  135.660      1 Template:Infobox_creature\n 55.30%   91.675      1 Template:Infobox_creature/internal\n 19.57%   32.450      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 10.53%   17.464      5 Template:Template_style\n  8.52%   14.132      1 Template:DiQ\n  8.21%   13.608      1 Template:Quote_fancy\n  8.15%   13.505      3 Template:Infobox_creature/passives_query\n  5.38%    8.916      5 Template:Main_namespace_only\n  4.86%    8.061      4 Template:Icon_link\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:50059-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715063902 and revision id 400297. Rendering was triggered because: a